Package: creditor
Title: R Interface to the Loro CRDT Library
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Colin", "Rundel", , "cr173@duke.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Exploratory R bindings to the Loro Rust crate, a library of
    conflict-free replicated data types (CRDTs). Create documents, edit
    collaborative text, and exchange snapshots and updates between
    replicas that merge without conflicts.
URL: https://github.com/rundel/creditor, https://rundel.github.io/creditor/
BugReports: https://github.com/rundel/creditor/issues
